error: $REPO/examples/agents/retriever.yaml:32:11: fs.watch "./config/": $REPO/examples/agents/config does not exist [path-missing]
  fix: create it or remove the entry; run refuses to start for a missing watch entry
warning: $REPO/examples/agents/retriever.yaml:47:16: limits.stall_after counts only what the run records, and at tier landlock under record: summary a read is not recorded: an agent that does nothing but read for 10m is ended as stalled [stall-reads-unseen]
  fix: set record: full, under which every read is a line, or pin a root tier (cgroup or bpflsm) with a stall_after of at least 10s, whose recorder counts reads in aggregates it flushes every 5s; or raise stall_after past the longest stretch of reading
error: invalid contract: $REPO/examples/agents/retriever.yaml:32:11: fs.watch "./config/": $REPO/examples/agents/config does not exist [path-missing]
